Once you were full of regret.
And fractured time to visit the multiverses of your untaken decisions.
Yet the entropy creeps fast.
People vanish, buildings crumble, monsters hatch.
It is now a struggle to scavenge for the resources needed to rejoin humanity.
To come back to the universe where your life has meaning.
Where your loved ones wait.
Escape the loop through the maze of time!


